  "description": "The brutal fate is colored by the warm moonlight and becomes love.\n\nYuri, the Fifth Princess, stopped growing at the age of 12 after her mother, a lowly dancer, died. But her days of living in hiding in a remote corner of the palace came to a swift end when she was chosen by the Emperor as the fourth bride of the Black King, the ruler of the northwestern part of the empire and a man who made a name for himself on the battlefield from the age of 14.\n\nThe same Black King whose previous three imperial brides all met untimely deaths, earning him the nickname of the Bride-Eating War Demon. \n\nWill this marriage turn out to be an opportunity for Princess Yuri or will it end up being just another misfortune?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=9722841), [MComics](https://www.mcomics.co.kr/webtoonComic/11698), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/62756506), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/845040188), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/comic/ep_list/moon_light), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/moonlit_sword), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000059516), [Yes24](https://www.yes24.com/Product/Goods/123122595), [KyoboBook](https://ebook-product.kyobobook.co.kr/dig/epd/ebook/E000005434706) \n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://manga.line.me/product/periodic?id=Z0003136)",
